    "title": "Junior Investment Banker at Equitas Small Finance Bank Ventures Solutions",
    "description": "Equitas Small Finance Bank Ventures Solutions invites applications from qualified candidates for the position of Investment Banker at our Nagpur location. This role offers excellent career advancement prospects.\n\nAbout Equitas Small Finance Bank Ventures Solutions:\nEquitas Small Finance Bank Ventures Solutions is a leading organization in the Hybrid sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Process payroll and manage employee reimbursements\n• Prepare and analyze financial statements, reports, and budgets\n• Prepare MIS reports for senior management review\n• Maintain general ledger and ensure accurate bookkeeping\n• Manage credit risk assessment and loan appraisal processes\n• Monitor financial performance against targets and provide variance analysis\n• Liaise with banks, regulators, and financial institutions\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• MBBS / MD / MS from recognized medical college\n• 6-10 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in Income Tax\n• Proficiency in IFRS\n• Proficiency in SAP FICO\n• Proficiency in Power BI\n• Proficiency in Financial Modeling\n• Proficiency in Ind AS\n• Proficiency in Python for Finance\n• Proficiency in QuickBooks\n\nWork Mode: Hybrid - Flexible work-from-home and office\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Comprehensive health insurance for self and family\n• Flexible working hours\n• Work-from-home flexibility\n• Life and accident insurance\n• Learning & development budget\n• Modern office with recreational facilities\n• Salary Range: 12 LPA - 25 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Nagpur, Maharashtra, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with Equitas Small Finance Bank Ventures Solutions!",
